      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1352921654,
      "text": "Cinnamomum sintoc is a species of tree in the laurel family (Lauraceae). It is native to Borneo, Sumatra, Peninsular Malaysia, and Java. It is a tree growing to 27 metres tall, with a trunk to 30 cm in diameter."
    },
